        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1209] SECC shall not send _L2, _L3 values in any messages (ChargeParameterDiscoveryRes, AC_ChargeLoopRes) if it neither received _L2 nor _L3 values in ChargeParameterDiscoveryReq.",
