            "block_content": "[V2G20-1822] In the context of ThreePhase energy transfer, if an EV is only capable of 2 phase energy transfer, it shall during the ChargeParameterDiscoveryReq communicate its capabilities in accordance to requirement [V2G20-1821] and mark the unused phase by using the value zero.",
